+# P5 reference-frame prompts and inspection notes
+
+## Style head
+
+Premium cinematic painted 3D-cartoon illustration, same world and finish as the reference desk; one consistent light setup — warm oil-lamp key light from the desk, cool moonlit rim from a back window; soft volumetric light, gentle bloom on highlights, shallow depth of field, rich smooth gradients with fine film grain and no banding; consistent perspective and scale across frames; restrained, handcrafted, studio-quality game-art polish.
+
+## Beat 1 — Arrival
+
+Premium cinematic painted 3D-cartoon illustration, same world and finish as the reference desk; one consistent light setup — warm oil-lamp key light from the desk, cool moonlit rim from a back window; soft volumetric light, gentle bloom on highlights, shallow depth of field, rich smooth gradients with fine film grain and no banding; consistent perspective and scale across frames; restrained, handcrafted, studio-quality game-art polish.
+
+Use case: stylized-concept
+Asset type: approval reference frame for a scroll-driven study app.
+Input image: attached reference desk, style/world reference only.
+Primary request: Arrival, a wide 3:2 landscape shot of an ancient Greek study at night. A glossy dark wooden desk occupies the lower-right; on it sit a clay oil lamp, rolled parchment scrolls, reed pen, closed leather book, and a bronze water-clock bowl. The lamp is the only warm source: its pool of amber light glows across the desk and catches sparse dust drifting through it. A stone back wall and a quiet shadowy window establish the room; leave the upper-left and upper-center dark and elegant.
+Text (verbatim): "Herophilus" — large, crisp, elegant high-contrast serif title, exactly this single word, centered in the dark upper area.
+Constraints: no people, hands, faces, statues, Clepsydra, UI elements, logos or watermark; no other text; no neon or modern objects.
+
+Inspection: The requested title is legible and correct. The window and extra ceramic vessel make the room brighter and more furnished than a study lit only by the lamp.
+
+## Beat 2 — Push-in
+
+Premium cinematic painted 3D-cartoon illustration, same world and finish as the reference desk; one consistent light setup — warm oil-lamp key light from the desk, cool moonlit rim from a back window; soft volumetric light, gentle bloom on highlights, shallow depth of field, rich smooth gradients with fine film grain and no banding; consistent perspective and scale across frames; restrained, handcrafted, studio-quality game-art polish.
+
+Use case: stylized-concept
+Asset type: approval reference frame for a scroll-driven study app.
+Input image: attached reference desk, style/world reference only.
+Primary request: Push-in, 3:2 landscape, camera closer at desk height in the same ancient Greek study. Clear cinematic depth: a bundle of scrolls softly out of focus in the foreground left, oil lamp, parchment, reed pen and bronze water-clock bowl crisp in the middle plane, then a back-wall window framing a calm night harbour. A soft cool moonlight shaft crosses the room diagonally, balanced against the warm desk lamp. No lettering anywhere.
+Constraints: no people, hands, faces, statues, Clepsydra, UI, badges, buttons, logos, watermark, neon, purple-cyan palette, or modern objects.
+
+Inspection: Strong depth and a calm harbour are present. The intended moonlight shaft is subtle rather than clearly diagonal.
+
+## Beat 3 — The day's sheet
+
+Premium cinematic painted 3D-cartoon illustration, same world and finish as the reference desk; one consistent light setup — warm oil-lamp key light from the desk, cool moonlit rim from a back window; soft volumetric light, gentle bloom on highlights, shallow depth of field, rich smooth gradients with fine film grain and no banding; consistent perspective and scale across frames; restrained, handcrafted, studio-quality game-art polish.
+
+Use case: stylized-concept
+Asset type: approval reference frame for a scroll-driven study app.
+Input image: attached reference desk, style/world reference only.
+Primary request: The day's sheet, a 3:2 landscape desk-height view in the same ancient Greek study. A pale parchment sheet lies unrolled across the entire lower half of the composition, warmly lit by the clay oil lamp. The wooden desk, scrolls, reed pen, leather book and bronze water-clock bowl remain in their established world but secondary. Parchment surface has generous clean space.
+Text (verbatim): "Today" — one large crisp elegant serif word precisely spelled, centered on the parchment; beneath it exactly three short, faint, unlabeled horizontal ink lines.
+Constraints: no other text, no people, hands, faces, statues, Clepsydra, UI elements, logos, watermark, neon, or modern objects.
+
+Inspection: “Today” is legible and correct, with exactly three faint ink lines. The word and lines are more centered/larger than a restrained sheet treatment.
+
+## Beat 4 — The four subjects
+
+Premium cinematic painted 3D-cartoon illustration, same world and finish as the reference desk; one consistent light setup — warm oil-lamp key light from the desk, cool moonlit rim from a back window; soft volumetric light, gentle bloom on highlights, shallow depth of field, rich smooth gradients with fine film grain and no banding; consistent perspective and scale across frames; restrained, handcrafted, studio-quality game-art polish.
+
+Use case: stylized-concept
+Asset type: approval reference frame for a scroll-driven study app.
+Input image: attached reference desk, style/world reference only.
+Primary request: The four subjects, 3:2 landscape in the same ancient Greek study. Four substantial closed leather books float or advance gently toward the camera in a staggered composition above the wooden desk, with no words or marks on their spines. Their spine colors are, distinctly: terracotta #b4472f, sage #5c7a52, muted violet #6d4c7d, and deep blue #2e5f8a. Each book has tasteful warm rim-lit edges and a separate thin glowing antique-gold progress ring beside it, integrated as a subtle magical study-world effect. Background desk objects recede softly; rings are not UI badges.
+Constraints: no lettering, people, hands, faces, statues, Clepsydra, modern UI, pills, buttons, logos, watermark, neon or purple-cyan palette.
+
+Inspection: Four unlettered books and gold rings are present. The sage book appears olive/tan rather than clearly #5c7a52, and several rings are partially hidden behind the books.
+
