+
+Premium cinematic painted 3D-cartoon illustration, same world and finish as the reference desk; one consistent light setup — warm oil-lamp key light from the desk, cool moonlit rim from a back window; soft volumetric light, gentle bloom on highlights, shallow depth of field, rich smooth gradients with fine film grain and no banding; consistent perspective and scale across frames; restrained, handcrafted, studio-quality game-art polish.
+
+Use case: stylized-concept
+Asset type: approval reference frame for a scroll-driven study app.
+Input image: attached reference desk, style/world reference only.
+Primary request: Reward moment, 3:2 landscape in the same ancient Greek desk study. The bronze water-clock bowl on the right side is the focus: its water visibly rises and glows rich antique gold from within, casting brighter warm reflections across the glossy wooden desk, parchment, scrolls and clay oil lamp. A restrained soft bloom surrounds the bowl and a few tiny ember-like golden particles lift gently above the desk. The room is brighter for this single satisfying beat; cinematic weight, painted magic, not neon. No lettering.
+Constraints: no people, hands, faces, statues, Clepsydra, UI elements, badges, buttons, logos, watermark, neon, purple-cyan palette, or modern objects.
+
+Inspection: The gold water, warm reflection and restrained particles are present. The water level reads mainly as a luminous surface rather than an unambiguously risen water level.

